      "side": 1,
      "message": "To paraphrase slightly, our analysis tests (currently) cannot mock out soong.variables / the current product. They just rely on whichever is the currently lunched product at test execution time. \n\nThis integration test is better because it keeps the TARGET_PRODUCT hermetic within the test.\n\nAlso, the actions being tested here are not actions of the minimal apex, but the CcCompile action of the _deps_ of the minimal apex. The aquery approach makes getting those deps in the apex configuration simple.",
      "parentUuid": "3d56ecde_514f5c6d",
      "revId": "858815e37e06fc5ed0738421b4d442a64a79419b",
